  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s economic participation and rights in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme involves three organizations: National Association of Women&apos;s Organizations in Uganda (NAWOU), FIDA Uganda, East African Sub-regional Support Initiative for the Advancement of Women (EASSI). All the organizations are working to increase the economic independency of women and advocate for women&apos;s economic rights in Uganda. Business and Women&apos;s Human Rights is an important component in the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
